#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0616 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "O-3 (Fix #336): the _wildcards UPPER-bound pin, moved from index 10 to index 100. `y` is (\\d+) so TRCMPG100/TRCMPG100N match and capture y=100, but `_wildcards: y: {min: 1, max: 99}` rejects it, leaving no instances -> NoMatch -> SKIPPED. Data is deliberately inconsistent (HIGH and LOW both coded 1) to prove structure alone is not the cause. If this reports a violation the filter is not being applied - escalate, do not rewrite."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID    type=Char
col USUBJID    type=Char
col TRCMPG100  type=Char
col TRCMPG100N type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | HIGH | 1
S1 | 002 | LOW  | 1
---
